<title>ITALY: Cir H1 1996 pretax loss 18.9 bln lire.</title>
<headline>Cir H1 1996 pretax loss 18.9 bln lire.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Group consolidated results</p>
<p>    Turnover			 6,932.5  vs   up 8.7 pct</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 369.5  vs   269.1</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			 18.9  vs   151.5 loss</p>
<p>    Shareholders equity	  5,001    vs 5,114.6 (at end 1995)</p>
<p>    Net debt			 1,463.6  vs 1,601.4</p>
<p>NOTE - CIR is an Italian holding company under the chairmanship of Carlo De Benedetti.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
